      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get it but my doctor is totally booked for like two weeks and im literally breaking down here from no sleep. i dont want to deal with a whole thing at the hospital. if i just took something else like a regular cough syrup that doesnt have that stuff in it, would that be fine? like maybe just some benadryl or something just to shut my lungs up and help me pass out? or is there something else i can take that definitely wont mess with my sertraline?",
